{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/s1_sub_018.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/s1_sub_018.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_woman_01",
      "hash64": "2E13479A8E038F9F",
      "text": "我们啊～是一对\\n超级相亲相爱的情侣，对吧～？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_man_01",
      "hash64": "A4BEB69B60D0EE99",
      "text": "说的对！即使在宝可梦当中，\\n也不存在像我们这样\\r\\n无时无刻都在一起的情侣吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_woman_02",
      "hash64": "2E13489A8E039152",
      "text": "就是！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_woman_03",
      "hash64": "2E13499A8E039305",
      "text": "……这位路人！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_woman_04",
      "hash64": "2E13429A8E038720",
      "text": "如果你找到像我们这么\\n相亲相爱的宝可梦！\\r\\n就带来给我们看看吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_man_02",
      "hash64": "A4BEB39B60D0E980",
      "text": "我觉得不会有就是了！\\n啊～哈哈～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_woman_05",
      "hash64": "2E13439A8E0388D3",
      "text": "你找到无时无刻\\n都相亲相爱的宝可梦了吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_man_03",
      "hash64": "A4BEB49B60D0EB33",
      "text": "怎么可能有啦！\\n啊～哈哈～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_man_04",
      "hash64": "A4BEB99B60D0F3B2",
      "text": "这宝可梦……\\n看上去并没相亲相爱的感觉！\\r\\n啊～哈哈～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_man_05",
      "hash64": "A4BEBA9B60D0F565",
      "text": "什、什么？一对鼠！？\\c\\n无论何时都待在一起的亲密情侣，\\n２只成对相亲相爱！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_man_06",
      "hash64": "A4BEB79B60D0F04C",
      "text": "什、什么？一家鼠！？\\c\\n它们相亲相爱得\\n都生下心肝宝贝了！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_man_07",
      "hash64": "A4BEB89B60D0F1FF",
      "text": "什、什么？一家鼠！？\\c\\n它们太过相亲相爱，都生２只小孩了！？\\n亲密程度都超过一家了！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_woman_06",
      "hash64": "2E13449A8E038A86",
      "text": "原来在宝可梦当中……\\n也有像我们这么相亲相爱的情侣啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_woman_07",
      "hash64": "2E13459A8E038C39",
      "text": "谢谢你带来给我们看！\\n让我教你个动作来答谢你吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_system_01",
      "hash64": "715C9973D3928E94",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]从情侣那里\\n学会了[VAR 0xFF00(0008)]爱心（右）动作[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]和\\r\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0008)]爱心（左）动作[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
